title: oneuniverse
abstract: >-
  Unified galaxy survey catalog package for low-redshift cosmology: ingest,
  standardise, cross-match, weight and package heterogeneous survey data into a
  cosmology-free MeasurementSet, plus a simulation storage substrate and a
  digital-twin data-to-simulation coupling layer.
